# Build-context / bundler exclusions -- keep the image and the Lambda asset small.
# This file governs BOTH the root Dockerfile build context (standalone image,
# FR-E3 / AC-E3.5) and the CDK PythonFunction asset bundling (whose asset entry
# is the repo root). The image/asset should contain only runtime source + deps.

infra/
tests/
docs/
.github/
.git/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
cdk.out/
node_modules/
